{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-navigation","type":"group","x":-900,"y":-50,"width":700,"height":1860,"label":"导航、状态与安全边界","color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-main-path","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-50,"width":950,"height":1860,"label":"Pi Agent 运行主链","color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-extension","type":"group","x":950,"y":-50,"width":800,"height":1860,"label":"Extension 扩展面","color":"3"},
		{"id":"title-overview","type":"text","x":-900,"y":-440,"width":2650,"height":300,"text":"# Pi Agent 整体架构\n\n**核心判断：Pi 的轻量是 loop-engine 主链只保留统一模型调用、agent loop、工具协议与运行时状态归约。**\n\n本文按三个视角阅读：\n1. 中间：宿主 → 产品层 → Agent → agentLoop → 模型 / 工具；\n2. 右侧：Extension 如何经加载、注册和绑定进入既有端口；\n3. 左侧：状态由谁拥有，以及工具准入为什么不等于 sandbox。"},
		{"id":"main-doc","type":"file","file":"study-notes/AI/harness-engineering/Pi/01-Pi-自上而下整体架构.md","x":-800,"y":40,"width":500,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"state-ownership","type":"text","x":-800,"y":400,"width":500,"height":390,"text":"## 状态所有权\n\n- **SessionManager**：JSONL 会话树与持久事实\n- **AgentSession**：产品生命周期、资源、压缩与事件 fan-out\n- **Agent**：当前 transcript、队列、运行锁与 AbortController\n- **agentLoop**：单次 run 的局部控制流\n- **Provider stream**：单次模型响应\n- **UI / RPC / SDK**：事件投影，不是真相源","color":"5"},
		{"id":"lightweight-summary","type":"text","x":-800,"y":850,"width":500,"height":360,"text":"## 轻量体现在哪里\n\n1. 轻的是 **loop-engine 概念内核**，不是整个仓库；\n2. 依赖单向，内层不知道 TUI、会话文件和具体工具；\n3. cwd、Models、stream、tools、storage 均可注入；\n4. sub-agent、plan mode、permission UI 由更低层端口组合；\n5. CLI、RPC、SDK 复用同一个 AgentSession。\n\n> `pi-agent-core` 同包还存在 `harness/` / `AgentHarness` 厚壳并行路径。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"sandbox-boundary","type":"text","x":-800,"y":1270,"width":500,"height":260,"text":"## Tool boundary ≠ Sandbox\n\n工具查找、schema、hook 和 execute 只决定**动作是否进入执行**。\n\nOS sandbox、容器或 microVM 才限制进程实际可访问的文件、网络、凭证和资源。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"sandbox-doc","type":"file","file":"study-notes/AI/harness-engineering/harness-survey-etclovg/01-E-执行环境与沙箱.md","x":-800,"y":1580,"width":500,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"host-entry","type":"text","x":20,"y":40,"width":710,"height":170,"text":"## L4 · 宿主与入口\n\nInteractive CLI · Print/JSON · RPC · SDK\n\n接收输入、管理进程形态、消费事件；所有入口收敛到 `AgentSession`。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"product-runtime","type":"text","x":20,"y":290,"width":710,"height":260,"text":"## L3 · pi-coding-agent 产品运行层\n\n- `AgentSession`：产品调用面与事件中枢\n- `SessionManager`：JSONL 会话树\n- `ResourceLoader`：settings / extensions / skills / prompts / themes\n- system prompt、具体工具、compaction、retry、模型选择\n\n资源发现与 system prompt 装配发生在 session 创建或 reload，而不是每次 prompt。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"agent-shell","type":"text","x":20,"y":640,"width":710,"height":190,"text":"## L2a · Agent 有状态运行壳\n\n保存当前消息、模型、工具、运行锁、AbortController、steering / follow-up 队列和 listeners。\n\n**职责：循环负责转，Agent 负责管。**","color":"5"},
		{"id":"agent-loop","type":"text","x":20,"y":920,"width":710,"height":200,"text":"## L2b · agentLoop 无状态循环\n\n模型请求 → assistant message → tool call → ToolResult 回写 → 再次请求模型。\n\n只持有单次 run 的局部 context、turn 和工具批次；产出通过 `AgentEvent` 向外广播。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"pi-ai","type":"text","x":-10,"y":1210,"width":390,"height":250,"text":"## L1 · pi-ai\n\n`Models / Provider / Auth / StreamFunction`\n\n统一 provider 的请求、thinking、tool call、usage、错误与流式事件。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"tool-pipeline","type":"text","x":420,"y":1210,"width":360,"height":250,"text":"## 工具副作用边界\n\n`prepare → execute → finalize`\n\n查找工具、校验参数、前后 hook、执行并封装 ToolResult。失败进入模型上下文，而不是让 loop 崩溃。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"external-llm","type":"text","x":-10,"y":1550,"width":390,"height":150,"text":"## 外部 LLM API\n\nAnthropic · OpenAI · Google · Bedrock · 兼容 Provider","color":"6"},
		{"id":"external-world","type":"text","x":420,"y":1550,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"## 外部世界\n\n文件系统 · shell 进程 · 网络 · 外部 API\n\n由宿主执行环境决定实际权限。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"extension-sources","type":"text","x":1050,"y":40,"width":600,"height":180,"text":"## 1 · 来源\n\nCLI `-e` · settings · 全局目录 · 项目目录 · Pi package · SDK inline factory","color":"3"},
		{"id":"extension-resolve","type":"text","x":1050,"y":300,"width":600,"height":190,"text":"## 2 · ResourceLoader / PackageManager\n\nresolve · trust gate · filter · dedupe · diagnostics\n\n项目 trust 是加载决策，不是运行隔离。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"extension-load","type":"text","x":1050,"y":570,"width":600,"height":180,"text":"## 3 · Loader\n\n使用 jiti 串行执行 extension factory，保证注册顺序确定；单个加载错误转为 diagnostic。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"extension-setup-bind","type":"text","x":1050,"y":830,"width":600,"height":240,"text":"## 4 · Setup → bindCore\n\nSetup 阶段允许异步 I/O 与注册；依赖活动 session 的 action 仍是 throwing stubs。\n\nRunner 绑定真实 action、包装工具和 handler，并 flush pending provider registrations。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"extension-capabilities","type":"text","x":1050,"y":1150,"width":600,"height":300,"text":"## 5 · 运行期能力\n\n- **加**：tool、command、shortcut、flag、provider、resource path\n- **拦**：input、context、tool_call、tool_result、session/provider events\n- **画**：dialog、notify、widget、header/footer/editor、renderer\n\nUI 能力取决于宿主；无 UI 模式应检查 `ctx.hasUI`。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"extension-boundary","type":"text","x":1050,"y":1530,"width":400,"height":210,"text":"## Extension API 边界\n\nAPI 不提供修改 agentLoop、Agent reducer 或既有 session entry 的入口。\n\n这只是兼容性边界，不是安全隔离；Extension 同进程，继承 Pi 进程当前 OS 用户的权限、环境变量与凭证。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"extension-doc","type":"file","file":"study-notes/AI/harness-engineering/Pi/official-doc/08-Extensions-扩展编写.md","x":1480,"y":1530,"width":170,"height":210,"color":"3"}
	],
